{"images":["data:image/webp;base64,"],"messages":[{"content":"An open water jet exits from a nozzle into sea-level air, as shown, and strikes a stagnation tube. If the centerline pressure at section (1) is 110 kPa and losses are neglected, estimate the mass flow in kg/s. <image>\n\n(A) 0.04 kg/s\n(B) 4.19 kg/s\n(C) 5.25 kg/s\n\nAnswer with the option's letter from the given choices directly.","role":"user"}]}